.nh
.TH "PB-STATUS" "1" "Sep 2026" "Paperboat" "Paperboat CLI"

.SH NAME
pb-status - Show local Paperboat machine status


.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBpb status [machine] [flags]\fP


.SH DESCRIPTION
Show local Paperboat machine status

.PP
Show the local endpoint's Paperboat state or the selected device's observed status. This is a snapshot rather than a readiness wait; use doctor for a deeper check, service status for supervisor state, and pb wait for a named readiness condition.

.PP
JSON output is supported with --json.


.SH OPTIONS
\fB-h\fP, \fB--help\fP[=false]
	help for status

.PP
\fB--json\fP[=false]
	print JSON


.SH OPTIONS INHERITED FROM PARENT COMMANDS
\fB--config\fP=""
	path to the CLI config file

.PP
\fB--no-customization\fP[=false]
	ignore local shortcuts, command defaults, and TUI preferences

.PP
\fB--server\fP=""
	paperboat-server base URL override


.SH SEE ALSO
\fBpb(1)\fP
